(481, 61, 439, 0, 'activity', '1. Show the class a picture of a smart home (a lamp that turns on by itself, a fan that knows the temperature, etc.).\n2. Explain that these things have tiny helpers called sensors that tell them what to do.\n3. Give each child a simple picture card of a sensor (light sensor, temperature sensor, motion sensor) and a matching picture of a device that uses it (lamp, fan, door alarm).\n4. Ask the children to walk around the classroom and find objects that could use each sensor (e.g., a window for light, a heater for temperature, a door for motion).\n5. When they think they found a match, they place the sensor card next to the object.\n6. After 10 minutes, gather together and let each child tell the class why they matched the sensor with that object.\n7. Celebrate the discoveries with a short clap and a sticker for every correct match.', NULL, NULL, 6.00, '{\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Finding Correct Matches\",\"max_points\":2,\"levels\":[{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"points\":2,\"description\":\"All matches are correct and clearly explained.\"},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Most matches are correct with brief explanations.\"},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Few matches are correct; explanations are unclear.\"},{\"label\":\"Needs Improvement\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"No correct matches.\"}]},{\"name\":\"Participation & Collaboration\",\"max_points\":2,\"levels\":[{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"points\":2,\"description\":\"Actively moves, helps peers, and shares ideas.\"},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Participates most of the time.\"},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Participates only a little.\"},{\"label\":\"Needs Improvement\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Rarely participates.\"}]},{\"name\":\"Communication of Idea\",\"max_points\":2,\"levels\":[{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"points\":2,\"description\":\"Explains why the sensor fits the object using clear words.\"},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Gives a simple explanation.\"},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Explanation is vague or incomplete.\"},{\"label\":\"Needs Improvement\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Does not explain the match.\"}]}]}', '2026-11-21 12:13:28'),
