(438, 2, 33, 13, 1, 15, 'IoT', 'activity', '1. Gather the class in a circle and talk briefly about the Internet of Things (IoT) – things that can talk to each other, like a smart lamp or a sensor.\n2. Show a picture of a simple sensor (e.g., a light sensor) and explain it helps a device know if it is bright or dark.\n3. Give each child a small picture card of everyday objects (e.g., a TV remote, a microwave, a smartwatch, a lamp). \n4. Ask the children to walk around the classroom and place the cards on the objects that could be part of the IoT (objects that have tiny computers inside).\n5. After 10 minutes, bring everyone back and let each child point to the object they chose and say one reason why it might be a \"smart\" thing.\n6. Teacher records the correct matches on a chart (e.g., TV remote ✔, microwave ✔, pencil ✘).', NULL, NULL, 12.00, 'ai', 42, 'archived', '{\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Finding Smart Objects\",\"max_points\":4,\"levels\":[{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"points\":4,\"description\":\"Correctly identified all 4 smart objects.\"},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"points\":3,\"description\":\"Identified 3 smart objects correctly.\"},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"points\":2,\"description\":\"Identified 2 smart objects correctly.\"},{\"label\":\"Needs Improvement\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Identified 0‑1 smart objects correctly.\"}]},{\"name\":\"Reasoning\",\"max_points\":4,\"levels\":[{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"points\":4,\"description\":\"Gave a clear, correct reason for each object.\"},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"points\":3,\"description\":\"Gave a correct reason for most objects.\"},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"points\":2,\"description\":\"Gave a vague or partially correct reason.\"},{\"label\":\"Needs Improvement\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Could not explain why the objects are smart.\"}]},{\"name\":\"Collaboration & Participation\",\"max_points\":4,\"levels\":[{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"points\":4,\"description\":\"Worked well with classmates and stayed on task.\"},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"points\":3,\"description\":\"Participated most of the time, minor distractions.\"},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"points\":2,\"description\":\"Participated occasionally, needed reminders.\"},{\"label\":\"Needs Improvement\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Rarely participated or disrupted the activity.\"}]}]}', '2026-11-21 12:00:02', '2026-11-21 12:00:39', 'quiz'),
(439, 2, 34, 13, 1, 15, 'IoT', 'activity', '1. Show the class a picture of a smart home (a lamp that turns on by itself, a fan that knows the temperature, etc.).\n2. Explain that these things have tiny helpers called sensors that tell them what to do.\n3. Give each child a simple picture card of a sensor (light sensor, temperature sensor, motion sensor) and a matching picture of a device that uses it (lamp, fan, door alarm).\n4. Ask the children to walk around the classroom and find objects that could use each sensor (e.g., a window for light, a heater for temperature, a door for motion).\n5. When they think they found a match, they place the sensor card next to the object.\n6. After 10 minutes, gather together and let each child tell the class why they matched the sensor with that object.\n7. Celebrate the discoveries with a short clap and a sticker for every correct match.', NULL, NULL, 6.00, 'ai', 43, 'archived', '{\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Finding Correct Matches\",\"max_points\":2,\"levels\":[{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"points\":2,\"description\":\"All matches are correct and clearly explained.\"},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Most matches are correct with brief explanations.\"},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Few matches are correct; explanations are unclear.\"},{\"label\":\"Needs Improvement\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"No correct matches.\"}]},{\"name\":\"Participation & Collaboration\",\"max_points\":2,\"levels\":[{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"points\":2,\"description\":\"Actively moves, helps peers, and shares ideas.\"},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Participates most of the time.\"},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Participates only a little.\"},{\"label\":\"Needs Improvement\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Rarely participates.\"}]},{\"name\":\"Communication of Idea\",\"max_points\":2,\"levels\":[{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"points\":2,\"description\":\"Explains why the sensor fits the object using clear words.\"},{\"label\":\"Good\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Gives a simple explanation.\"},{\"label\":\"Fair\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Explanation is vague or incomplete.\"},{\"label\":\"Needs Improvement\",\"points\":1,\"description\":\"Does not explain the match.\"}]}]}', '2026-11-21 12:13:03', '2026-11-21 12:14:15', 'quiz'),
